1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,340
Do you know a big friend?

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:03,540
It's a pair of numbers that make ten!

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,000
Six and four.

4
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:06,260
Seven and three.

5
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:07,720
Eight and two.

6
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:08,960
Nine and one.

7
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,180
Five and five!

8
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:15,960
When the ones rod is too full to add, a big friend lets us use the tens rod!

9
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,460
Alert, the closing bell is near!

10
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:20,760
Twenty-six plus nine is stuck!

11
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,080
There's no room to add nine.

12
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,660
Call the friend, Spark!

13
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,200
Nine's friend is one!

14
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:31,900
Take away one, then add ten!

15
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:34,720
Twenty-six plus nine is thirty-five!

16
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:36,000
Scoreboard's back!

17
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:37,620
Another one!

18
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,900
Sixty-five plus five is stuck!

19
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:42,080
There's no room to add five.

20
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,240
Friend, quick!

21
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:47,780
Five's friend is five!

22
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:50,600
Take away five, then add ten!

23
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,140
Sixty-five plus five is seventy!

24
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:54,260
Keep it moving!

25
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:57,080
Sixty-seven plus eight is stuck!

26
00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:59,260
There's no room to add eight.

27
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:00,260
Friend time!

28
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,620
Eight's friend is two!

29
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,400
Take away two, then add ten!

30
00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:10,360
Sixty-seven plus eight is seventy-five!

31
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:11,420
Almost there!

32
00:01:12,180 --> 00:01:13,520
Last one before the bell!

33
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,860
Seventy-nine plus six is stuck!

34
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:18,180
There's no room to add six.

35
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:19,340
One more friend!

36
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:23,820
Six's friend is four!

37
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:26,580
Take away four, then add ten!

38
00:01:27,320 --> 00:01:29,660
Seventy-nine plus six is eighty-five!

39
00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:31,660
Bell's ringing, we made it!

40
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:34,060
Every stuck number has a trick.

41
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:38,540
Learn them all with Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
